      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "“All our work seeks to mitigate, prevent and advance remediation of human rights violations. We commit to aligning our policies and processes with the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights. In case Fairtrade certified actors breach human rights in Fairtrade Standards, we seek to protect the impacted people and facilitate effective corrective measures,”"
    },
